   "text": "Checkout incident review (29-30 September 2026)\n\nSummary: the deployment of checkout failed after the dependency upgrade to httpclient 4.2. The new version introduced a timeout regression: payment gateway calls timed out after 30 s because httpclient 4.2 changed the default connection pool size.\n\nImpact: card payments failed for Globex and other customers for about two hours on each day. Globex wrote that its renewal is at risk.\n\nRemediation: pin httpclient to 4.1 (https://github.com/acme/checkout/pull/483) and raise the pool size before upgrading again. Tracking issue: https://github.com/acme/checkout/issues/482\n"},
